# Architecture

Modular Next.js monolith. Do not introduce microservices, always-on workers, WebSockets, or BullMQ.

Stack: Next.js App Router, TypeScript strict, Tailwind, shadcn/ui, Apollo Client, GraphQL Yoga, Prisma, PostgreSQL (Neon), Cloudflare R2, Resend, Stripe webhooks, Vercel serverless.

Put business logic in `modules/<domain>/` (service + validation + GraphQL). UI components must not query Prisma. Derive `organizationId` from the session, never from client input.

Vercel-compatible only: no local filesystem storage, no in-memory sessions, no long-running processes. Use Vercel Cron + DB state for scheduled work.

After each phase: typecheck, lint, and fix before continuing. Keep the repo buildable.
